[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3300248651","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110567#issuecomment-3300248651","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110567","id":3300248651,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7EtcxL","user":{"login":"JDvideos","id":105085354,"node_id":"U_kgDOBkN5qg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105085354?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JDvideos","html_url":"https://github.com/JDvideos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JDvideos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JDvideos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JDvideos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JDvideos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JDvideos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JDvideos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JDvideos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JDvideos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JDvideos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-16T20:27:50Z","updated_at":"2025-09-16T20:27:50Z","body":"Can confirm, I recorded two videos of the issue:\n**Godot 4.4.1 (working as expected):**\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1h_o-w8ZDIWKn84KBOx8QxtEYcBJ2T1ex/view\n\n**Godot 4.5 (moving incorrectly):**\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1ry0vRWHJ1xwrjZRzB3ud5-g6uuYnSGYD/view","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3300248651/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3300441454","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110567#issuecomment-3300441454","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110567","id":3300441454,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7EuL1u","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-16T21:41:26Z","updated_at":"2025-09-19T10:25:45Z","body":"> ERROR: Navigation region synchronization error. More than 2 edges tried to occupy the same map rasterization space. This is a logical error in the navigation mesh caused by overlap or too densely placed edges.\n\nPlease do not ignore navigation map or region rasterization errors showing up in debug.\nWhen edges are merged wrong or not at all due to layout issues the pathfinding will be broken, no exception.\n\nYou likely had the very same issue in Godot 4.4.1 but just did not notice because other edges were affected. The rasterization logic has not changed, only order has.\n\nIf the cause of that error is just tiny edges sprinkeled over the layout you can go to the ProjectSettings and set `navigation/2d/merge_rasterizer_cell_scale` to a smaller value. If the error does not go away even with the smallest value possible you have some navmesh overlap created somewhere.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3300441454/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3319157215","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110567#issuecomment-3319157215","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110567","id":3319157215,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7F1lHf","user":{"login":"foohines","id":4998620,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5OTg2MjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4998620?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/foohines","html_url":"https://github.com/foohines","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foohines/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foohines/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foohines/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foohines/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foohines/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foohines/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foohines/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foohines/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/foohines/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-22T13:48:22Z","updated_at":"2025-09-22T13:48:22Z","body":"Here's a MRP that shows the same or a similar issue, but doesn't raise any errors during navmesh baking or runtime.\n\nIt works fine in 4.4.1, but not in 4.5\n\n\n**Repo**: https://github.com/foohines/godot-4.5-navigation-bug\n\n**Zip** [godot-4.5-navigation-bug-main.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22467611/godot-4.5-navigation-bug-main.zip)